<main class="write-main"><div class="writer-head"><div><span class="writer-kicker">One booking · one sender</span><h1>Booking email identities</h1><p>Replies and service updates use the mailbox attached when the visitor books. No automatic switch to another sender.</p></div><a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/communication?tab=availability')?>">Availability</a></div>
<?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="program-card"><h2>Connect a sending mailbox</h2><p>Connect each Google Workspace or Gmail account separately, then confirm its identity and a public label. A calendar connection does not authorize email sending. Send-only access does not read the inbox or change calendar permissions.</p><p>Add this Authorized redirect URI to the existing Google Cloud web client:</p><code><?=e(publishing_callback_url('google_booking_mail'))?></code><form method="post" action="<?=url('/write/connections/google_booking_mail/start')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn primary">Connect Google sending account</button></form><p>The standard website booking link currently uses the configured website sender. Use a mailbox-specific link below for an organisation booking. All links use the same verified availability and current calendar destination; changing email identity does not move the calendar organizer.</p></section>
<?php foreach($mailboxes as$m):?><section class="program-card"><h2><?=e($m['email'])?></h2><p>Status: <?=e($m['status'])?></p><?php if($m['status']!=='disconnected'):?><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=e($m['id'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="confirm"><label>Public booking label<input name="label" maxlength="120" value="<?=e($m['label'])?>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="sending_consent" value="1" required>Allow booking receipts, confirmations, declines, changes and reminders from this exact mailbox</label><button class="wbtn">Confirm this sender</button></form><?php endif;?><?php if($m['status']==='connected'):?><p>Mailbox-specific booking link:</p><a href="<?=url('/book?host='.$m['id'])?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><?=e(url('/book?host='.$m['id']))?></a><p>Private email address is not part of the link; visitors see your public label.</p><?php endif;?><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=e($m['id'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="disconnect"><button class="wbtn">Disconnect local sending access</button></form></section><?php endforeach;?></main><link rel="stylesheet" href="<?=asset('css/program.css')?>">
